{'symbol': 'O', 'date': '2021-04-13 21:35:00', 'title': '610TH CONSECUTIVE COMMON STOCK MONTHLY DIVIDEND DECLARED BY REALTY INCOME', 'text': 'SAN DIEGO, APRIL 13, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- REALTY INCOME CORPORATION (REALTY INCOME, NYSE: O), THE MONTHLY DIVIDEND COMPANY®, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED THE 610TH CONSECUTIVE COMMON STOCK MONTHLY DIVIDEND. THE DIVIDEND AMOUNT OF $0.235 PER SHARE, REPRESENTING AN ANNUALIZED AMOUNT OF $2.82 PER SHARE, IS PAYABLE ON MAY 14, 2021 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF MAY 3, 2021.'}